            </section>

            <div style="font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                Sistem Donanımı
            </div>
            <div class="device">
                <div class="row">
                    <span class="key">Marka / Model</span>
                    <span class="val">@Manufacturer / @Model</span>
